  "conclusions": [
    "Both chains have 9 correct and 1 partially correct answer in the same 10 preregistered random questions; p38 is the shared automatic-judge miss.",
    "Among the 11 deliberately selected disagreement questions, native has 2 correct/7 partially correct/2 incorrect; Q4 has 2/4/5.",
    "Automatic judging missed non-fully-correct answers in both chains. The single-error denominator in each random group does not establish a population miss rate of 100%.",
    "These results do not establish equal overall quality or a human accuracy for all 90 questions. Existing automatic counts 83/90 and 79/90 remain unchanged."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "One human review record per answer; reviewer counts and item-level reasons were not recorded.",
    "Random sample contains only 10 questions; disagreement cases are selected and must not be pooled into a population estimate.",
    "The 90 questions are not a fresh independent benchmark; 22 were used for pilot diagnosis.",
    "本次未主动重建或更新检索语料。BM25及登记的8张Chroma逻辑表哈希一致，覆盖87条嵌入、元数据及含向量BLOB的队列。chroma.sqlite3、data_level0.bin、length.bin物理哈希变化；另3文件一致。Chroma持久化客户端具备写入能力，变化可能来自初始化或维护，未追踪具体原因。未校验其他13张表，也未独立证明HNSW内部状态完全相同，不能声称完整物理索引逐字节冻结。",
    "Observed latency and API cost differences remain confounded by output length, call count, caching, and execution order."
  ]
